  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen Partnerships Against Violent Extremism in Kollo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to assist the Government of Niger and local communities in preventing violent extremist organizations from recruiting in the Kollo region of Niger by working to strengthen the Government of Niger and law enforcement&apos;s partnerships with community leaders and local organizations. The project also seeks to establish a network of local leaders to engage with the community and provide an opportunity for citizens to express their concerns and perspectives on the drivers of violent extremism.</narrative>
  </description>
